# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads from the repository root for
# service/Dockerfile. It does not read .dockerignore, so this mirrors it.
#
# Deliberately not `#!include:.gitignore`: gcloud matches .gitignore's `data/*`
# against every directory called data, not only the root one git means, and
# that silently dropped src/marketscan/data/ from the upload. Every pattern here
# is anchored with a leading slash for the same reason.
/.git/
/.github/
/out/
/runs/
/web/
/docs/
/bindings/
/theories/
/tests/
/scripts/
/research/tests/
/data/cache/
/data/recordings/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
.env*
